<title>THAILAND: Thai money markets closed for New Year's holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai money markets closed for New Year's holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's money markets were closed on Wednesday for New Year's Day holiday.</p>
<p>The overnight interbank rate finished at 14.00-14.50 percent on Monday, while the baht firmed to 25.630-25.640 to the dollar in quiet dealings.</p>
<p>The money markets will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
